<dispatchitem code="00013893.0003001" func-code="28-26-01" item-list-nbr="01" revdate="2019-05-22T00:00:00"><title>Center Tank Transfer Valve</title><ditembody nb-installed="2"><dispcond code="00013893.0003001.001" dispcond-id="D07165" dispcond-label="B" lid="N.00013893.0003001.001"><title>One inoperative closed</title><normal-dispcond nb-required="1" rectification-interval="C"><placard/><remark><requirement lid="N.00013893.0003001.002" req-id="R07166"><opsproc-ref><duref product="MMEL" ref="00013913"/></opsproc-ref><qualifiers><qualifier value="CREW_OPS"/></qualifiers><para code="00013893.0003001.002" layer="1" lid="N.00013893.0003001.003">One may
be inoperative in the closed position provided that the flight routes
permit a landing at a suitable airport if the remaining center tank
transfer valve fails with fuel in the center tank.</para></requirement></remark></normal-dispcond></dispcond><dispcond code="00013893.0003001.003" dispcond-id="D07167" dispcond-label="E" lid="N.00013893.0003001.004"><title>Both inoperative closed</title><normal-dispcond nb-required="0" rectification-interval="C"><placard/><remark><requirement lid="N.00013893.0003001.005" req-id="R07168"><qualifiers><qualifier value="LOADSHEET"/><qualifier value="FUEL_PLANNING"/><qualifier value="REFUEL"/></qualifiers><para code="00013893.0003001.004" layer="1" lid="N.00013893.0003001.006">Both may be inoperative in the closed
position provided that there is no fuel in the center tank or the
fuel in the center tank is considered as not usable and as part of
the <abb>ZFW</abb> and is taken into account for <abb>CG</abb> determination.</para></requirement></remark></normal-dispcond></dispcond><dispcond code="00013893.0003001.005" dispcond-id="D07169" dispcond-label="F" lid="N.00013893.0003001.007"><title>One or both inoperative open</title><normal-dispcond nb-required="0" rectification-interval="C"><placard/><remark><requirement lid="N.00013893.0003001.008" req-id="R07170"><qualifiers><qualifier value="REFUEL"/></qualifiers><para code="00013893.0003001.006" layer="1" lid="N.00013893.0003001.009">One or both may be inoperative in the
open position provided that there is no fuel in the center tank.</para></requirement></remark></normal-dispcond></dispcond></ditembody></dispatchitem>